text.paragraph:
Each mL of moxifloxacin ophthalmic solution contains 5.45 mg moxifloxacin hydrochloride, equivalent to 5 mg moxifloxacin base. Moxifloxacin ophthalmic solution contains

  Active:Moxifloxacin 0.5% (5 mg/mL);

  Inactives:Boric acid, sodium chloride and water for injection. May also contain hydrochloric acid/sodium hydroxide to adjust pH to approximately 6.4 to 7.4.
